{
  "name": "dsh-mobile-model-search",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "手机端「选择模型」弹层增强：提供方筛选标签 + 模型收藏（★ 每行右侧常驻星标，不依赖悬停）。官方内核自带搜索框时不再重复添加。 · Mobile model picker: provider filter pills + favorites with an always-visible star per row (no hover on touch devices).",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "mobile",
    "model-picker",
    "favorites"
  ]
}
